{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56619","headline":"唐镜铭 · 无名氏","name":"唐镜铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赏得秦王镜，判（《金石索》一作「浙」）不惜千金。\n非关欲照胆，特是自明心。\n（以上二首见一九七九年《中国考古学会第一次年会论文集》刊孔祥星《隋唐铜镜的类型与分期》引。\n後一首又见《金石索·金索六》有二件，又见民国十五年钱祥保纂《续修江都县志》卷十五《金石》，云爲邑人程青岳所藏。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}